    "* **Monotonic Mean Dice Improvement:** Iteration 1 is the first correction round (using the Iteration 0 baseline prediction, adding 1 foreground + 1 background single-voxel click, and running inference). With single-voxel clicks, cohort Mean Dice improves monotonically across all 5 rounds: `0.4977` (Iter 0) $\\to$ `0.5525` (Iter 1) $\\to$ `0.5735` (Iter 2) $\\to$ `0.5845` (Iter 3) $\\to$ `0.5932` (Iter 4) $\\to$ `0.5985` (Iter 5), achieving a Mean-curve AUC of `0.5704`. Severe baseline failures are steadily rescued (`train_0011`: `0.0000` $\\to$ `0.2269` at Iter 1 $\\to$ `0.4314` at Iter 5; `train_0013`: `0.0175` $\\to$ `0.3288` at Iter 1 $\\to$ `0.4248` at Iter 5).\n",
