    "| **Mean Dice (Model Pre)** | 0.4977 | 0.5525 | 0.5735 | 0.5845 | 0.5932 | 0.5985 |\n",
    "| **Median Dice (Model Pre)** | 0.5912 | 0.5971 | 0.5978 | 0.5992 | 0.6024 | 0.6046 |\n",
    "| **Mean Dice (+ Hole Filling Only)** | 0.4978 | 0.5524 | 0.5734 | 0.5844 | 0.5934 | 0.5988 |\n",
    "| **Mean Dice (+ Full: Hole + $< 1\\text{ mL}$ Filter)** | 0.4859 | 0.5419 | 0.5629 | 0.5741 | 0.5833 | 0.5888 |\n",
    "| **Mean FN Voxel Volume, Pre ($\\text{mL}$)** | 378.58 | 345.90 | 335.34 | 330.45 | 327.30 | 324.88 |\n",
