    "\n",
    "* **Qualitative Successes (Recovering Missed Lesions & Steady Gains):** Single-voxel interactivity was decisive when the baseline suffered from false negatives:\n",
    "  * `train_0011`: Dice rose steadily across every single round (`0.0000` $\\to$ `0.2269` $\\to$ `0.3409` $\\to$ `0.3654` $\\to$ `0.4131` $\\to$ `0.4314`), cutting voxel-level FN volume in half from `112.22 mL` to `53.60 mL` and post-processed lesion-level FNV from `112.22 mL` to `8.46 mL`.\n",
