    "### 4. Study Limitations\n",
    "* **Small-$n$ & Single-Tracer Scope:** Due to cloud compute and storage constraints (20 GB Kaggle workspace limit), evaluation was restricted to $n = 10$ positive PSMA exams without FDG negative controls.\n",
    "* **Annotation Protocol:** DeepPSMA reference masks (`TTB.nii`) are generated via SUV thresholding ($\\text{SUV} \\ge 3.0$) with manual physiological uptake removal, which differs from the freehand clinical contours used in the main autoPET cohort.\n",
    "* **Voxel-Level Click Simulation vs. Lesion-Level Stopping Criterion:** The click simulator places 1 FG and 1 BG click per round on the largest voxel-level error components unconditionally across all 5 rounds, whereas a real clinician would stop clicking once major lesions are captured or avoid clicking thin boundary rims."
